From 7ef7141d487a3e5fa1da95490b75d2663bf5216c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 16:37:28 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Add Equipment Inventory tab to Engineering Tools

- New Supabase-backed equipment_inventory table (category, name,
  description, technical spec, cost/currency, datasheet file) with a
  storage bucket for uploaded datasheet PDFs (SQL in supabase/).
- New "Equipment Inventory" card alongside Quote Tool and Design Pack
  Generator: searchable, category-grouped list with add/edit (modal
  form + PDF upload) and remove, backed by Supabase.
- Seed data for the SQL script carries over the ~30 items already in
  the datasheet catalog (manifest.json) so existing equipment doesn't
  need to be re-entered.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Sonnet 5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_013ovpLTsM8zbL5hPPYNhkdk
